# wcdraft — local env template. Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) and paste
# real values. NEVER commit a populated copy. NEVER paste these values into
# CI logs, screenshots, or chat.
#
# `.gitignore` excludes `.env` and `.env.*` but allows `.env.example` so this
# template stays committed as a sign-post.

# ─── Phase F (F-1) — Neon Postgres ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Both URLs come from the SAME Neon branch (NEVER prod for development).
#
# DATABASE_URL          → POOLED URL  (host: ...-pooler.neon.tech)
#                         Used by runtime route handlers in F-2/F-3/F-4 via
#                         `getDb()` from @wcdraft/db. Pooling prevents the
#                         serverless-function concurrency spike from blowing
#                         past Postgres' connection cap.
# DATABASE_URL_UNPOOLED → DIRECT URL  (host: ...neon.tech, no `-pooler`)
#                         Used by CLI migrations (`pnpm --filter @wcdraft/db
#                         db:migrate` / `db:rollback-check`). Pooled URLs
#                         reject the CREATE/ALTER-in-transaction pattern
#                         drizzle-orm's migrator uses, so this MUST be the
#                         direct URL.
#
DATABASE_URL=
DATABASE_URL_UNPOOLED=
